            &lt;p&gt;We regret to inform you that your Ready Card will be deactivated within the next hour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the result of changes made by our card provider, which affects cards used primarily outside the EEA. We’re sorry for the disruption.&lt;/p&gt;
